OL,4,G2300FThe 6 Mix with Mary Anne Hobbs
OL,5,     GWe welcome PVAS to the 6 Mix, he
OL,6,     Gis Jordan Juras, a Berlin-based
OL,7,     Gartist who grew up outside of
OL,8,     GWindsor, Ontario, now releasing
OL,9,     Gmusic on Objekt's label Kapsela.
OL,10,G0000F6 Music's Rave Forever
OL,11,     GDisco-tinged tracks to soundtrack
OL,12,     Gyour Christmas party season.
OL,13,     GFeaturing music from Jamiroquai,
OL,14,     GSister Sledge, Alan Fitzpatrick
OL,15,     Gand Patrice Rushen.
OL,16,G0100FForever Dark
OL,17,     G6 Music takes you to the dark
OL,18,     Gside with a playlist featuring
OL,19,     Gthe finest goth, electronic and
OL,20,     Gdark pop tracks around.
